o gale lagaaun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.710" end="00:45.010">Kisi aur ki mujhko zaroorat kya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.010" end="00:47.620">Main to khud se pyaar jataaun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.620" end="00:49.120">What’s my name?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.980" end="00:50.480">what’s my name?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.350" end="00:51.850">what’s my name?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.550" end="00:55.960">My name is Sheila, Sheila ki Jawani</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.960" end="00:57.460">I am too sexy for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.000" end="01:01.230">Main tere haath na aani</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.230" end="01:05.450">No no no no Sheila, Sheila ki Jawani</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.450" end="01:07.560">I am too sexy for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.560" end="01:10.760">Main tere haath na aani</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.760" end="01:18.760" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.730" end="01:40.080">Silly silly silly boys</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.080" end="01:44.270">Mujhe follow follow karte hain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.270" end="01:47.300">Ho.. jab unki taraf dekho</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.300" end="01:49.360">Baatein haule haule karte hain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.360" end="01:54.490">Hai magar be-asar mujh pe har paintra</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.490" end="01:56.700">Haaye re! aise tarse humko</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.700" end="01:59.250">ho gaye sau arse re</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.250" end="02:01.550">Sookhe dil pe megha banke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.550" end="02:03.770">teri nazariya barse re</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.770" end="02:05.270">I know you want it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.860" end="02:06.360">But you never gonna get it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.770" end="02:08.710">Tere hath kabhi naa aani</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.710" end="02:12.060">Sheila, Sheila ki Ja